  "description": "This Building Block proposes a schema representation of the OpenEO process [`not`](https://processes.openeo.org/#not) \u2014 *Inverting a boolean*. It models the `arguments` object of a process graph node invoking `not`. This is a proposed correspondence between the OpenEO process definition and an OGC Building Block schema, not a settled equivalence.\n\nInverts a single boolean so that `true` gets `false` and `false` gets `true`.\n\nNo-data values are passed through.\n\n## Source\n\nOpenEO Processes specification: [`not`](https://processes.openeo.org/#not) ([openeo-processes/not.json at 2.0.0-rc.2](https://github.com/Open-EO/openeo-processes/blob/2.0.0-rc.2/not.json)).\n",
